  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFF 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to strengthen social cohesion, respect for diversity, understanding and trust, amongst young men and women, towards a more democratic and peaceful BiH. To support progress towards reconciliation and strengthened relationships within and across communities, by (i) enabling inclusive and progressing dialogue on key issues of relevance to sustainable peace; (ii) follow-up to the dialogue via youth-led community initiatives and advocating with relevant government institutions; (iii) provision of quality and inclusive education , as well as education focused on non-violence and peace, and (iv) the promotion of cultural diversity, shared heritage and pluralism.</narrative>
  </description>
